<title>ITALY: Italian GDP rose 0.1 pct yr/yr in Q4 96.</title>
<headline>Italian GDP rose 0.1 pct yr/yr in Q4 96.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's gross domestic product (GDP) rose by 0.1 percent, year-on-year, in the fourth quarter of 1996, National Statistics Institute Istat said.</p>
<p> ITALIAN GDP			   Q4 1996    Q3 1996   Q4 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		   +0.1	 +0.6 (r)  +2.5 (r)</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter   -0.2	 +0.5 (r)  +0.3 (r)</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	 348.87     349.66    348.42</p>
<p>Note: Istat confirmed that GDP grew 0.7 percent in 1996 against 2.9 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>	  (r) denotes revised data.</p>
<p>Istat gave the following breakdown:</p>
<p> FINAL CONSUMPTION		  Q4 1996    Q3 1996  Q4 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		 +0.8	 +0.8 (r)   +1.1 (r)</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter +0.1	 +0.3 (r)   -0.1 (r)</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)     272.88     272.50 (r) 270.76 (r)</p>
<p> FIXED INVESTMENTS		  Q4 1996    Q3 1996    Q4 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		 -1.9	 +0.1 (r)   +8.4 (r)</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter -0.3	 -0.3 (r)   +1.7 (r)</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	62.1	 62.30 (r)  63.31 (r)</p>
<p> STOCK VARIATIONS		    Q4 1996    Q3 1996  Q4 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		   N/A	  N/A	 N/A</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter   N/A	  N/A	 N/A</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	 +.31	-1.20	+4.74</p>
<p> EXPORTS OF GOODS AND SERVICES   Q4 1996    Q3 1996  Q4 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		 +3.4	  +1.8 (r)   +5.5 (r)</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter -1.0	  +3.4 (r)   -2.6</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	86.98	 87.87	84.10 (r)</p>
<p> IMPORTS OF GOODS AND SERVICES   Q4 1996    Q3 1996  Q4 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		 -1.4	  -4.0 (r)   +5.6 (r)</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter +2.2	  +2.8 (r)   -0.4</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	73.41	 73.41 (r)  74.48 (r)</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
